This sounds like propagation of algae from unbleached to bleached coral, not colonization of skeletal structure.<p>&gt;
Nobody involved with any of this consulted a marine biologist with a rudimentary understanding of coral<p>Hmm.<p>&gt; Stephen Palumbi:
Jane and Marshall Steel Jr. Professor of Marine Sciences, Professor of Oceans and of Biology<p><a href="https:&#x2F;&#x2F;profiles.stanford.edu&#x2F;stephen-palumbi?releaseVersion=11.5.3" rel="nofollow">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;profiles.stanford.edu&#x2F;stephen-palumbi?releaseVersion...</a><p>You sure he doesnt have even a rudimentary understanding of coral? Did <i>you</i> read the paper? I&#x27;m going to assume the marine biologist publishing papers has at least some idea on corals, unless give a good reason to doubt it.

